---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Matlack Electric"
  description="Matlack Electric is a premier residential electrical contractor built for renovations — partnering with homeowners, designers, and contractors on wiring, smart home, and energy systems."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p>Electrical craftsmanship built around renovations.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>
        Matlack Electric is a residential electrical contractor built specifically
        for renovation and remodeling projects. We work closely with homeowners,
        designers, architects, and general contractors to deliver the electrical
        systems that make a renovation feel complete - from structural wiring to
        custom lighting design and modern smart home technology. Our focus is
        quality: clean installations, thoughtful design, and the professionalism
        a renovation deserves.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Licensed &amp; Insured</h3>
        <p>Fully licensed and insured for residential electrical work of every scope.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Renovation Specialists</h3>
        <p>Focused on remodels, partnering with designers, architects, and GCs from rough-in to final trim.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Smart Home &amp; Energy Systems</h3>
        <p>From Lutron lighting control to EV chargers and battery backup, we bring modern systems into every project.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
